  "display_title": "The Knight and Her Emperor",
  "description": "The talented but overlooked knight Pollyanna comes face to face with an ambitious king who finally acknowledges her worth. \"I like hard workers, because I am one,\" Luxos II declares, as he shares his dream of unifying the continent. Moved by his vision Pollyanna vows to fight in his honor, and together the two set out to build a grand empire. But what happens when the young king slowly realizes, battle after battle, that this stalwart knight has conquered his heart? Based on the hit novel. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
